# AI Task Orchestrator - Analysis and Guide Creation Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User/Service
  participant OR as AITaskOrchestrator
  participant PM as PluginManager
  participant FS as Filesystem

  Note over OR: Async-first analysis
  U->>OR: analyze_task_async(task_description)
  OR->>PM: PRE_ANALYZE (async/sync awaited)
  OR-->>OR: Perform analysis (LLM/memory/etc.)
  OR->>PM: POST_ANALYZE (async/sync awaited)
  OR-->>U: TaskAnalysis

  Note over OR: Guide creation (sync or async context)
  U->>OR: create_implementation_guide(TaskAnalysis, output_dir?)
  OR->>PM: PRE_GENERATE_GUIDE
  OR->>FS: Ensure directory, write UTF-8 Markdown
  OR->>PM: POST_GENERATE_GUIDE(Path)
  OR-->>U: Path
```

## Description

This diagram shows the basic flow of task analysis and implementation guide creation in the AI Task Orchestrator. It demonstrates:

1. **Async-first analysis**: The orchestrator analyzes tasks asynchronously with plugin hooks
2. **Guide creation**: After analysis, implementation guides are generated with filesystem operations
